**Main defect (F1, major).** The criterion (ii) checklists for the resolver and for question routing omit that the prompt never shows the keys' question examples. D4.p3 and D8.p3 name these as matching inputs, and every minted key carries them. This bears directly on criterion (ii) and on the design-or-model class.

